EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},


As we highlighted in prior correspondence, your account is currently {!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c} past due, which can cause the account to incur late fees and penalties. To avoid this we need to get the account brought current.

Please let us know which of the following options would best work for you at this time:

1. a one-time payment of {!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}; or
2. an increase of {!Case.Payment_Amount__c} to your existing payment for the next {!Case.Payments_Behind__c} payments.

We look forward to hearing from you.

Thank you,


{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone} | F: {!User.Fax}




